WEBVTT

00:00.418 --> 00:12.533
Ka soo qaad inaan haysano isle'egta toddoba lagu dhuftay x waxay le'egtahay afar iyo toban

00:12.533 --> 00:15.867
Haddaba ka hor inta aanan isku dayin furfurka isle'egta

00:15.867 --> 00:19.737
Waxa aan rabo inaan sameeyo waa ka fakirka micnaha isle'egta

00:19.737 --> 00:22.430
Toddoba x waxay le'egtahay afar iyo toban

00:22.430 --> 00:39.427
Tani waxay la mid tahay adiga oo yiri toddoba lagu dhuftay x

00:39.427 --> 00:43.533
Haatan waxaa suurtagal ah inaad maskaxda ku xallisid

00:43.533 --> 00:45.743
Waxaad adeegasan kartaa jedwelka isku dhufashada ee 7

00:45.743 --> 00:48.762
Waxaad oran kartaa 7 lagu dhuftay 1 waxay le'egtahay 7, marka taasi ma shaqaynayso

00:48.762 --> 00:54.010
7 lagu dhuftay 2 waxay le'egtahay 14, marka 2 waa ku habboon tahay halkan

00:54.010 --> 00:56.424
Marka waxaa si dhakhso ah kuu suurtagal ah inaad hesho xalka

00:56.424 --> 00:59.257
Waxaad si dhakhso ah oran kartaa , adiga oo tijaabinaya tirooyin kala duwan,

00:59.257 --> 01:01.394
xalku wuxuu noqon doonaa 2

01:01.394 --> 01:03.716
Hase yeeshee waxa aynu rabno inaynu ku sameyno fiidyowgan waa

01:03.716 --> 01:05.666
sidee u sameynaa xal ku salaysan habdhis

01:05.666 --> 01:08.267
Maadaama aynu ogaan doono in marba marka ay isle'egahani

01:08.267 --> 01:10.728
kasii dhib bataan, suurtagal kuu noqon mayso

01:10.728 --> 01:12.586
inaad ka fakarto oo keliyo adigoo maskaxda ku sameynaya

01:12.586 --> 01:15.418
Marka waxaa dhab ahaanti muhiim ah inaad fahamto

01:15.418 --> 01:16.733
sida aad uga shaqayn lahayd isle'egahan, waxase ka sii muhiimsan

01:16.733 --> 01:18.251
inaad fahamto waxay u taagan yihiin.

01:18.251 --> 01:21.920
Tani waxay si toos ah u sheegaysaa in 7 lagu dhuftay x le'egtahay 14.

01:21.920 --> 01:24.753
Ma qorno calaamadda isku dhufashada markaynu qorayno
aljebrada

01:26.588 --> 01:28.422
Marka aad qortid laba tiro oo isku xiga ama tiro iyo

01:28.422 --> 01:30.419
doorssome isku xiga sida 7x, taas micneheedu waa adiga oo

01:30.419 --> 01:32.090
isku dhufunaya
